63512093a26b.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement “The zeros of the function are exactly $x=n\\pi.$” is true. The zeros occur at $x=0,\\pm\\pi,\\pm2\\pi,\\ldots,$ which can be written as $x=n\\pi.$\n\n- Statement “The vertical asymptotes are exactly $x=2n\\pi.$” is false. The function has an asymptote at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ and the period is $\\pi.$ Therefore, the asymptotes occur at $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$\n\n- Statement “The range of the function is $(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2}).$” is false. The function takes values on all the real numbers, hence the range is $(-\\infty,\\infty).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is “The zeros of the function are exactly $x=n\\pi.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186515955 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186176049 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4241c7bd-4a2b-556f-be9f-8a884addebb9" :knowledge-point/title "Describing Properties of the Tangent Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ac1ccbbf-2e1d-5283-8a4e-55267eec4969" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515972} {:answer/id #uuid "ddda8b05-602f-59e2-bda7-7dc6611e7e43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515995}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ddda8b05-602f-59e2-bda7-7dc6611e7e43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515995} :answer-field/id #uuid "20ae57ab-9695-5c55-894f-3a546c01e2a2" :answer-field/key "The vertical asymptotes are exactly $x=2n\\pi.$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515923} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4c4d576-c820-5cca-9e3c-dde43dfeabda" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 