ow, let's go through each statement.\n\n- The range of the function is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$.  Hence, statement “The range is $(-\\infty,-1]\\cup[1,\\infty)$” is true.\n\n- The cosecant graph does not intersect the $x$-axis. Hence, statement “The graph has a zero at $x=0$” is false.\n\n- The range is unbounded above and below, so the function has no global minimum or maximum. Hence, statement “The function has no global minimum or maximum” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517018 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186176053 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92d6129b-a5c5-597a-86ee-3f19af20f326" :knowledge-point/title "Describing the General Properties of the Cosecant Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02f9f559-f3f8-5ce6-b4a8-b320ed61a1f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516989} {:answer/id #uuid "4c2912b3-4d50-55a5-834c-4cef237e95e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517022}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4c2912b3-4d50-55a5-834c-4cef237e95e9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517022} :answer-field/id #uuid "18e2d3e0-60c9-515a-8e2e-56140786769b" :answer-field/key "The graph intersects the $y$-axis." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516995} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "22cc27ce-19fd-5c78-8e21-fecec18a25d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186516999} {:answer/id #uuid "9d335a5a-6a28-541d-af9f-b7e44f18eac2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186517057}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/i