nt. The curve is tangent to the $x$-axis at that point, so the root is not simple.\n\n- Statement “$x=-1$ is a root of even multiplicity” is true. The root $x=-1$ has an even multiplicity because at $x=-1$ the graph just touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction.\n\n- Statement “$p(x)\\to -\\infty$ as $x\\to -\\infty.$” is true. As $x$ moves left in the negative direction towards $-\\infty,$ the $y$ value moves down in the negative direction towards $-\\infty.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “$x=-1$ is a root of even multiplicity”; “$p(x)\\to -\\infty$ as $x\\to -\\infty.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518404 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129154 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a66188f6-3228-59e9-9766-0f9bacbe8443" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Regarding the Graph of a Given Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "035db86b-7ae5-5bb8-9096-9e7b849400c8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518346} {:answer/id #uuid "96a44a77-6e83-57a5-866c-659b906f3fdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518389}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "96a44a77-6e83-57a5-866c-659b906f3fdf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518389} :answer-field/id #uuid "4afe1235-047b-522e-b864-4c8ca2799e18" :answer-field/key "$x=-5$ and $x=2$ are simple roots." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518369} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56520c87-f809-5d95-9090-ab91506a2ae1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186518370} {:answer/id #uuid "f8cd4bf9-bc57-5794-9371-1283273f0cd0" :answer/type {:db/i