rve is not tangent to the $x$-axis at that point. The root $x=2$ has an odd multiplicity because the graph passes through the $x$-axis at this point. The curve is tangent to the $x$-axis at that point, so the root is not simple.\n\n- Statement “$x=-3$ is a root of even multiplicity” is true. The root $x=-3$ has an even multiplicity because at $x=-3$ the graph just touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction.\n\n- Statement “$p(x)\\to -\\infty$ as $x\\to -\\infty.$” is true. As $x$ moves left in the negative direction towards $-\\infty,$ the $y$ value moves down in the negative direction towards $-\\infty.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “$x=-3$ is a root of even multiplicity”; “$p(x)\\to -\\infty$ as $x\\to -\\infty.$” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519845 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25529d51-7d4c-589b-a9a1-4a24a0b50e6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519855} {:answer/id #uuid "b1b44e40-913a-580b-9ee8-f276e953cf51" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519894}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "25529d51-7d4c-589b-a9a1-4a24a0b50e6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519855} :answer-field/id #uuid "1719e5f7-eb85-5a76-bc95-51bc07547d8b" :answer-field/key "$y' + 3 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y = \\frac{4 \\cdot \\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{y}}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519848} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00cb1acf-e472-5fd0-824c-aad2f05210be" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519843} {:answer/id #uuid "92d05de7-0a56-530d-91c9-89b642ff40f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519881}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "92d05de7-0a56-530d-91c9-89b642ff40f5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519881} :answer-field/id #uuid "a40aeef9-b6c2-500f-9cd0-7be6ed86634f" :answer-field/key "$y' + 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y^{2} = x \\cdot y^{3}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519886} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "839db738-442f-57e4-a5c6-a94672a10cd8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519875} {:answer/id #uuid "a0c16ded-38fd-5b7e-bd9d-12a8cc403dcb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519884}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a0c16ded-38fd-5b7e-bd9d-12a8cc403dcb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519884} :answer-field/id #uuid "df6fa41f-6131-5f57-b475-864562ced595" :answer-field/key "$y' + 4 \\cdot \\sqrt{x} \\cdot y = 3 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519902}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "09ed8d3f-e8c4-5182-b1db-e5d98c04df75" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation $y' + 4 \\cdot \\sqrt{x} \\cdot y = 3 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\n- Equation $y' + 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y^{2} = x \\cdot y^{3}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $y' + 3 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y = \\frac{4 \\cdot \\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{y}}$ is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=3 \\cdot x^{2},\\quad q(x)=4 \\cdot \\sqrt{x},\\quad n=- \\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, select $y' + 3 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y = \\frac{4 \\cdot \\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{y}}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519852 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2df1b5ab-ed31-5bd3-8fc8-1dc0ccbc67c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519857} {:answer/id #uuid "76450ef9-648c-5b33-838f-16093077e363" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519874}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2df1b5ab-ed31-5bd3-8fc8-1dc0ccbc67c5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519857} :answer-field/id #uuid "0bc965c8-4776-5a91-92f3-2e53b74683f4" :answer-field/key "$y' - y^{2} \\cdot e^{x} = 5 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519846} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bcc22c11-ad6e-53a9-ad37-89362071a690" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519895} {:answer/id #uuid "d7fdf271-5129-5df3-a7b8-1e9c85fdbcc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519899}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d7fdf271-5129-5df3-a7b8-1e9c85fdbcc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519899} :answer-field/id #uuid "5d419543-53e7-599b-9d42-3d0cf3a99e4a" :answer-field/key "$y^{3}y' + 2 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 2 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519866} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f9b503d-2e05-5443-9427-ec4cfd41a371" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519854} {:answer/id #uuid "c019dbe8-f9d6-53b1-9f3f-9b12e20dc250" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519896}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1f9b503d-2e05-5443-9427-ec4cfd41a371" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519854} :answer-field/id #uuid "fc6a8639-f3d8-5d90-9205-383e799912c4" :answer-field/key "$yy' + 3 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} = \\cos^{2}{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519910}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1ca4778d-d0ee-5be1-91bb-deb87c2a6870" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation $y' - y^{2} \\cdot e^{x} = 5 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $y^{3}y' + 2 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 2 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$ is a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y^{3}$, we get\n\n$$\ny' + 2 \\cdot y \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = \\frac{2}{y^{\\frac{5}{2}}}\n$$\n\n In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=2 \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad q(x)=2,\\quad n=- \\frac{5}{2}.\n$$\n\n- Equation $yy' + 3 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} = \\cos^{2}{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y$, we get\n\n$$\ny' + \\frac{3 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}}{y} = \\frac{\\cos^{2}{\\left(y \\right)}}{y}\n$$\n\n The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\nTherefore, select $y^{3}y' + 2 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 2 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519860 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f457bc94-632a-5352-992e-e6c5a3424593" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519908} {:answer/id #uuid "f9239b0b-9b82-5bd6-9884-9a3032281b92" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519909}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f457bc94-632a-5352-992e-e6c5a3424593" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519908} :answer-field/id #uuid "085ba0ab-a4e5-5515-bf9d-4e1c2f9bf259" :answer-field/key "$y' + 2 \\cdot y \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = x \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519844} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f2ab4bd-2b5e-5363-b5dc-1ad703f3184a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519863} {:answer/id #uuid "ceaa54f6-1e4d-5baf-bb5e-f802dd30bf8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519898}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ceaa54f6-1e4d-5baf-bb5e-f802dd30bf8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519898} :answer-field/id #uuid "1726f0ce-5eb4-5ac5-b540-d18d2403b11c" :answer-field/key "$yy' - 5 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sqrt{y} = x^{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519849} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5b3bc395-fe4c-526e-b802-660027798152" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519865} {:answer/id #uuid "ec30e286-0384-5a12-9d88-b913c676a26b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519905}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ec30e286-0384-5a12-9d88-b913c676a26b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519905} :answer-field/id #uuid "aecef73e-7b03-515d-8ed8-0ba8a0e9f3b8" :answer-field/key "$y^{2}y' - x \\cdot y^{5} = 4 \\cdot y^{4}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519892}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "41658dd9-b512-54b4-8eaf-1cd8fd36a4fa" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation $y^{2}y' - x \\cdot y^{5} = 4 \\cdot y^{4}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y^{2}$, we get\n\n$$\ny' - x \\cdot y^{3} = 4 \\cdot y^{2}\n$$\n\n The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $yy' - 5 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sqrt{y} = x^{2}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y$, we get\n\n$$\ny' - \\frac{5 \\cdot x}{\\sqrt{y}} = \\frac{x^{2}}{y}\n$$\n\n The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $y' + 2 \\cdot y \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = x \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\nTherefore, select none of the given equations."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519864 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "86edd90a-cbf2-5c47-9f02-87079912ec1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519876} {:answer/id #uuid "efb0fac3-488f-5c16-a92b-35827149d2a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519907}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "efb0fac3-488f-5c16-a92b-35827149d2a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519907} :answer-field/id #uuid "74912bc0-52b8-5aa0-b06a-0755387008ec" :answer-field/key "$y' + x^{2} \\cdot y^{2} = 4 \\cdot x \\cdot y^{3}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519873} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3113515c-1f46-532f-ae88-74c781afb95c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519858} {:answer/id #uuid "c5f3ba73-4c8c-597a-986e-96013abdee10" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519897}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3113515c-1f46-532f-ae88-74c781afb95c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519858} :answer-field/id #uuid "90636727-ab0e-5549-b002-2849dcc536b9" :answer-field/key "$y' + \\sqrt{x} \\cdot y = 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519880} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2d1e255e-4ba8-5d4a-872a-060c20e7e9d2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519856} {:answer/id #uuid "ff444882-4e8a-5d15-8229-76c1d5a6924b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519912}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ff444882-4e8a-5d15-8229-76c1d5a6924b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519912} :answer-field/id #uuid "e0fd8d75-8221-5887-9705-81bb141810ed" :answer-field/key "$y' + 5 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y = \\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{y}}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519903}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "5442b8d0-4faf-5541-997c-b9a9b40fc3e0" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation $y' + \\sqrt{x} \\cdot y = 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\n- Equation $y' + x^{2} \\cdot y^{2} = 4 \\cdot x \\cdot y^{3}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $y' + 5 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y = \\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{y}}$ is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=5 \\cdot x^{2},\\quad q(x)=\\sqrt{x},\\quad n=- \\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, select $y' + 5 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y = \\frac{\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{y}}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519868 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "42b0e886-861f-5f24-a07d-d5ccb62ab994" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519861} {:answer/id #uuid "88cb15cd-6ff8-5a88-93cb-37fe932091e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519879}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "42b0e886-861f-5f24-a07d-d5ccb62ab994" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519861} :answer-field/id #uuid "af91b94c-0eb9-506e-93d0-903d4893b554" :answer-field/key "$y' - 2 \\cdot y \\cdot e^{x} = 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y^{5}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519893} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3dbf3d9a-2efd-50a9-8b49-746db7572310" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519859} {:answer/id #uuid "a4638151-d753-54a1-a9f3-d192129073b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519887}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3dbf3d9a-2efd-50a9-8b49-746db7572310" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519859} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9e7a0f8-3d9b-5bab-a562-2da45bcfa210" :answer-field/key "$y' + 3 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = - x \\cdot y^{3}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519900} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1b16748f-f5c4-59f1-adc0-055fdb384ee2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519851} {:answer/id #uuid "6cd02773-d136-5dac-b9e3-7d26d2f5517b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519869}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6cd02773-d136-5dac-b9e3-7d26d2f5517b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519869} :answer-field/id #uuid "e7b3d7fc-8e5d-577f-948d-1da2b0382c3c" :answer-field/key "$y' + \\frac{y^{3}}{x^{2}} = 5 \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519904}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "64fb57dc-e17c-52ab-9105-7fc9ff8e13d4" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation $y' + \\frac{y^{3}}{x^{2}} = 5 \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\n- Equation $y' - 2 \\cdot y \\cdot e^{x} = 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y^{5}$ is a Bernoulli differential equation. In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=- 2 \\cdot e^{x},\\quad q(x)=2 \\cdot x^{2},\\quad n=5.\n$$\n\n- Equation $y' + 3 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = - x \\cdot y^{3}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\nTherefore, select $y' - 2 \\cdot y \\cdot e^{x} = 2 \\cdot x^{2} \\cdot y^{5}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519891 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9856cd8f-1ecf-5090-b104-4a61b05f6c40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519882} {:answer/id #uuid "fcd67961-35d9-52b9-9614-7f044b5e3dc5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519911}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9856cd8f-1ecf-5090-b104-4a61b05f6c40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519882} :answer-field/id #uuid "1d67a8e9-5e92-5864-884f-542d26df09cc" :answer-field/key "$y' + y \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 2 \\cdot x \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519853} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "746f231b-c31e-52ec-8372-86806f91864c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519872} {:answer/id #uuid "a833f96f-7658-5c7e-872d-a2f9dcb8e16b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519890}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "746f231b-c31e-52ec-8372-86806f91864c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value 