equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $yy' - x \\cdot \\sqrt{y} = 5 \\cdot x^{2}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y$, we get\n\n$$\ny' - \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{y}} = \\frac{5 \\cdot x^{2}}{y}\n$$\n\n The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $y' + y \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 2 \\cdot x \\cdot \\log{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\nTherefore, select none of the given equations."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186519901 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186147456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "eef27d2b-6149-5070-b711-f4dcc7db2a03" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Bernoulli Differential Equations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "15d69431-018c-5b5e-a000-9cab76c113ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519847} {:answer/id #uuid "9bbb2fdc-ffde-5bb8-b4cc-0a43f19f25e1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519883}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "15d69431-018c-5b5e-a000-9cab76c113ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519847} :answer-field/id #uuid "4d31c640-54b5-558c-b015-d45299822063" :answer-field/key "$y' - 2 \\cdot y^{2} \\cdot e^{x} = \\sqrt{y}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519862} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a62d92bd-0da5-5ef0-b43b-e763b8d1c247" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519888} {:answer/id #uuid "a64ccefe-8627-5c4e-a65e-dbe768c7fda3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519889}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a64ccefe-8627-5c4e-a65e-dbe768c7fda3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519889} :answer-field/id #uuid "70769b38-d69b-5f8e-91d3-6fa4f6f54d3a" :answer-field/key "$y^{3}y' + 3 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 4 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519870} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73d7c09c-1279-59f9-ac82-7936019068f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519871} {:answer/id #uuid "882e8774-da1d-55db-84f3-841082753ae1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519878}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "882e8774-da1d-55db-84f3-841082753ae1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519878} :answer-field/id #uuid "a3669dae-d26b-5274-956c-3f319637ac07" :answer-field/key "$yy' + 3 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} = 2 \\cdot \\cos^{2}{\\left(y \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186519885}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "df2a747d-1fde-548a-9eec-41ea553db412" :question/problem "Which of the following equations is a Bernoulli differential equation?\n\nWork on intervals where $x>0$ and $y>0$, and where the displayed coefficients are defined.\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "A Bernoulli differential equation has the form\n\n$$\ny'+p(x)y=q(x)y^n.\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine the given options. Work on the stated positive domain, so dividing by powers of $y$ is valid.\n\n- Equation $y' - 2 \\cdot y^{2} \\cdot e^{x} = \\sqrt{y}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. The normalized equation contains two different powers of $y$, neither with exponent 1.\n\n- Equation $y^{3}y' + 3 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 4 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$ is a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y^{3}$, we get\n\n$$\ny' + 3 \\cdot y \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = \\frac{4}{y^{\\frac{5}{2}}}\n$$\n\n In this case, we have\n\n$$\np(x)=3 \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)},\\quad q(x)=4,\\quad n=- \\frac{5}{2}.\n$$\n\n- Equation $yy' + 3 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)} = 2 \\cdot \\cos^{2}{\\left(y \\right)}$ is *not* a Bernoulli differential equation. Dividing by $y$, we get\n\n$$\ny' + \\frac{3 \\cdot x \\cdot \\sin{\\left(y \\right)}}{y} = \\frac{2 \\cdot \\cos^{2}{\\left(y \\right)}}{y}\n$$\n\n The normalized equation contains a function of $y$ that is not a single power of $y$.\n\nTherefore, select $y^{3}y' + 3 \\cdot y^{4} \\cdot \\log{\\left(x \\right)} = 4 \\cdot \\sqrt{y}$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521758 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "84245283-3cf9-5889-8c42-896a0c8af291" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Points on a Curve at which the Tangent Vector is Perpendicular to a Given Vector"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5244335d-6970-5429-aa03-d3dec60b6ae0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521799} {:answer/id #uuid "dbde3a30-d25a-522f-935f-3e8b50dc20ed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521858}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5244335d-6970-5429-aa03-d3dec60b6ae0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521799} :answer-field/id #uuid "0442c6bd-1b78-5c99-ad02-d114eb9446c8" :answer-field/key "$(3,0)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521747} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2bcca2dc-e93a-558e-afac-54ae144ba53f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521775} {:answer/id #uuid "ab244f97-43eb-57ac-828c-fe7913efb4d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521837}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2bcca2dc-e93a-558e-afac-54ae144ba53f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521775} :answer-field/id #uuid "0b9b35e0-eec0-5034-8f33-49c3fb288348" :answer-field/key "$(3,6)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521755} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3c2c129a-aac1-5c11-a517-08a307cf978c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521785} {:answer/id #uuid "a655609d-28d2-5c5d-9357-2a9a49c8bdf6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521834}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a655609d-28d2-5c5d-9357-2a9a49c8bdf6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521834} :answer-field/id #uuid "4377d73f-e0ae-5355-9da8-86f2c7f533c5" :answer-field/key "$(3,12)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521789} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06fb16ac-e893-51b0-abb9-b191df46e080" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521750} {:answer/id #uuid "5135b9f5-3ff0-5dcb-bf6f-6769b8e27e1b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521797}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "06fb16ac-e893-51b0-abb9-b191df46e080" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521750} :answer-field/id #uuid "ac7dbd6c-1a1e-51c6-a4ba-ad8bbcb82f75" :answer-field/key "$(\\frac{3}{2},12)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521839} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ebf4b66-1c76-5d1d-9695-6113cde87fe1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521768} {:answer/id #uuid "c3fcc17e-6297-5fd5-8fb7-5d0519e2cf46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521849}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c3fcc17e-6297-5fd5-8fb7-5d0519e2cf46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521849} :answer-field/id #uuid "c455ae41-516c-5087-9292-187bc01c3ff1" :answer-field/key "$(-3,-12)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521850} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7fe93697-ea3f-5119-a24f-b497681320d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521819} {:answer/id #uuid "9655312b-299c-5150-92fb-924ba2114fd9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521825}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7fe93697-ea3f-5119-a24f-b497681320d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521819} :answer-field/id #uuid "e41e89b0-8613-5944-9948-dba717ba611f" :answer-field/key "$(0,12)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521860}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "10aa9a22-24d9-5578-9f7c-cc0b57f6bc72" :question/problem "At which points on the curve $8 x y + 2 y^{2}=16 x^{2} + 432$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}8 x y + 2 y^{2}&=16 x^{2} + 432\\\\- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432&=0\\end{aligned}$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y)=- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432$, our curve can be viewed as the level curve $f(x,y)=0.$\n\nA tangent vector to the level curve can be computed as follows:\n\n$$t(x,y)=f_y(x,y)\\,i-f_x(x,y)\\,j$$\n\nSo, we calculate $t(x,y):$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)&=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432)\\,i-\\frac{∂}{∂x}(- 16 x^{2} + 8 x y + 2 y^{2} - 432)\\,j\\\\&=(8 x + 4 y)\\,i-(- 32 x + 8 y)\\,j\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSince our tangent vector needs to be perpendicular to $j$, we must have $t\\cdot j=0.$\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}t(x,y)\\cdot j&=0\\\\32 x - 8 y&=0\\\\y&=4x\\end{aligned}$$\n\nSubstituting $y=4x$ into the equation of our curve gives:\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}2(4x)^{2}+8x(4x)-16x^{2}-432&=0\\\\48x^{2}-432&=0\\\\x^{2}&=9\\\\x&=\\pm 3\\end{aligned}$$\n\nFinally, the corresponding points are $(3,12)$ and $(-3,-12)$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521761 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186124456 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "84245283-3cf9-5889-8c42-896a0c8af291" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Points on a Curve at which the Tangent Vector is Perpendicular to a Given Vector"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a67e1549-d894-58c3-ab0c-c5878c485999" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521835} {:answer/id #uuid "ee1f00c6-1b40-51e8-8084-53cf529cfa21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521867}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ee1f00c6-1b40-51e8-8084-53cf529cfa21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521867} :answer-field/id #uuid "15959162-8202-56a1-a0f2-83319529d308" :answer-field/key "$(\\frac{1}{2},2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521763} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1582ef11-2a8f-56b8-be1e-533ad686623d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521762} {:answer/id #uuid "4d90e1ca-3cff-5a39-9cbc-7a04878d8001" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521796}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4d90e1ca-3cff-5a39-9cbc-7a04878d8001" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521796} :answer-field/id #uuid "4bf2940c-8256-52c6-be97-fc5e2aae3edc" :answer-field/key "$(0,2)$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521793} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "806a4800-e105-55cd-86c2-f0de72c7a66b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521820} {:answer/id #uuid "acf0d49c-0802-5936-9cc5-c