3187} :answer-field/id #uuid "8dc94f57-6ef6-5b16-95f9-1ae9415ced68" :answer-field/key "The system is inconsistent" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186523148}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "48bd3d4c-5e94-556e-bb2a-82b8de48db17" :question/problem "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+2z &=0 \\\\ -2x-y-7z &=-2 \\\\ 2x+11z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -7 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 11 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -7 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 11 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 11 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 7 & 4\\end{bmatrix} & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{2} \\\\ & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThere is a pivot for each variable and no contradictory row. The system has a unique solution, so we conclude that the system is consistent independent.\n\nAs a result, only statement “The system is consistent independent” is true."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186523134 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115299 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac" :knowledge-point/title "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answe