/id #uuid "bc243859-b6cc-502a-bf95-259667fad729" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557764}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6daf8fd9-1eff-5d73-b495-b7b1e84dd3ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557731} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb7d7075-905e-5751-8aff-80da43bf5d97" :answer-field/key "$D={C}^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557794}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "1bf116bc-02e4-562f-804b-4b92d837e3aa" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,D=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,E=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $CD=DC={I}_{2}.$ Computing $CD$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CD & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $DC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DC & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $CD=DC={I}_{2}$ is true. As a result, $D={C}^{-1}$ and statement $D={C}^{-1}$ is true too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $DE=ED={I}_{2}.$ Computing $DE$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}DE & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $DE=ED={I}_{2}$ is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $CD=DC={I}_{2}$; $D={C}^{-1}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557719 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087699 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c064270a-45b0-5d37-a64c-f9bd3cd9b591" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557769} {:answer/id #uuid "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557798}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc515591-2d15-5fb3-814a-53134068b49e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557798} :answer-field/id #uuid "30ed5c96-6ee0-5f39-93b3-2c433c407047" :answer-field/key "$AC=CA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557712} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557760} {:answer/id #uuid "e4092b17-5e2b-5dae-8d40-155034ad4c5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557786}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "af7d221a-e506-58c2-b708-2dc6e0aecacc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557760} :answer-field/id #uuid "3583ba2a-bb42-5b1a-b10d-98b42a330396" :answer-field/key "$AB=BA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557714} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56893b98-2738-501f-917d-58a00ce969f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557723} {:answer/id #uuid "c58b7fa5-e8fb-56df-8329-c2b7be0a6bab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557772}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c58b7fa5-e8fb-56df-8329-c2b7be0a6bab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557772} :answer-field/id #uuid "48af3418-177d-51b4-8173-40bf69d832e1" :answer-field/key "$C\\ne {A}^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557717}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4e4b2fd5-2934-5366-b945-a26f551d05d0" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked." :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $BA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AB=BA={I}_{2}$ is true.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{4} & \\frac{1}{2} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{4} & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{4} & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AB=BA={I}_{2}$; $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557740 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087699 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3a595b9f-2009-5cbb-a94f-e043f6b53b8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557716} {:answer/id #uuid "a8fa3fb1-f140-51b8-b6f4-7871b12200fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557754}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3a595b9f-2009-5cbb-a94f-e043f6b53b8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557716} :answer-field/id #uuid "012c00fa-4cb0-5960-a536-d71799c397f9" :answer-field/key "$G={E}^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557701} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7103b14f-02cf-5a7f-805e-