mputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{3} & \\frac{2}{3} \\\\ 1 & -\\frac{1}{2}\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{3}{5} & \\frac{6}{5} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5} & -\\frac{2}{5}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & \\frac{2}{15} \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement $AC=CA={I}_{2}$ is false. As a result, $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AB=BA={I}_{2}$; $C\\ne {A}^{-1}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557767 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087699 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "696039bf-4b19-5cb1-b178-6b29548d1105" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557730} {:answer/id #uuid "eabda44b-f9a8-5f27-b2fa-00740c2ab541" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557793}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "696039bf-4b19-5cb1-b178-6b29548d1105" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557730} :answer-field/id #uuid "00fcb256-4dfb-5083-89d1-c76082b6d89b" :answer-field/key "$D={C}^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557700} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5336188a-41c0-5ee3-b5ff-b215f42ed5a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557721} {:answer/id #uuid "99f095f1-43c3-57d7-b82b-34e083cf0de1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557748}] :answer