$C={A}^{-1}$ is true too.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $AC=CA={I}_{2}$; $C={A}^{-1}$ only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186557796 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087699 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Inverse of a 2x2 Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "58cf03af-8176-5bb0-b78f-02e392065bcc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557724} {:answer/id #uuid "ae2bfeeb-8629-57aa-9218-a109b80f97f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557757}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae2bfeeb-8629-57aa-9218-a109b80f97f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557757} :answer-field/id #uuid "13d4c9e5-cfb7-5da5-a46f-651c8e8beaf2" :answer-field/key "$AC=CA={I}_{2}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557706} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5f11ee68-1cd3-56f2-85d3-5aada7c69161" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557727} {:answer/id #uuid "b9235f58-a9e8-5ebf-aaec-2e2f7723f631" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557763}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b9235f58-a9e8-5ebf-aaec-2e2f7723f631" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557763} :answer-field/id #uuid "c8de493c-224a-5509-ba23-047e3c23f50d" :answer-field/key "$C={A}^{-1}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186557774} {:answer-fiel