ef 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562858} :answer-field/id #uuid "8307eb05-c0ad-51ff-8381-69c2aa369a62" :answer-field/key "The product $RO$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562884}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "795f6284-9977-53c9-b26a-515ee6438422" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -6 & -9 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -9 & 4 & 2 & 8 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 8 & 4 & -4 & -8 \\\\ -1 & 9 & -3 & -7 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $4\\times 5$ matrix, $P$ is a $1\\times 4$ row vector, and $R$ is a $2\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $R$ and $4$ rows in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $R$ and $O$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{O}_{4\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $P$ and $2$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{2\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $R$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe product $RP$ is well defined. The products $RO$ and $PR$ are undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562887 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02a6580c-0d89-558b-b971-11e565184416" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562853} {:answer/id #uuid "32a9097c-5bc2-5cd1-9baa-bd8b990c97fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562861}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "32a9097c-5bc2-5cd1-9baa-bd8b990c97fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562861} :answer-field/id #uuid "131a6720-5179-5e6b-8f36-e30376510b3e" :answer-field/key "The product $OR$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562857} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "58588f5a-9b68-55e3-be19-a5e5b6a4cf7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562873} {:answer/id #uuid "9feee51e-8401-51e5-96ac-227b7313667d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562893}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9feee51e-8401-51e5-96ac-227b7313667d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562893} :answer-field/id #uuid "45d82d62-d901-5b62-a460-0db146091d33" :answer-field/key "The product $RO$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562866} {:answer-field/