conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{1\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{4\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there is $1$ column in $R$ and $1$ row in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $R$ and $O$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{O}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 5}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe product $RO$ is well defined. The products $OR$ and $OP$ are undefined."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186562889 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100869 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6a813dd-19f7-54e1-a2c7-bd667d5aed30" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562903} {:answer/id #uuid "e19500d1-8755-5dc6-ac50-746ede9424ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562915}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e19500d1-8755-5dc6-ac50-746ede9424ca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562915} :answer-field/id #uuid "4d51da39-0b01-536b-bfb2-eec56fd78de6" :answer-field/key "The product $OP$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562870} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d8d70d25-2c3a-51bc-ba52-e7054852cfb5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562911} {:answer/id #uuid "f069bd38-0367-5fd7-9bc6-9d965655353a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562917}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f069bd38-0367-5fd7-9bc6-9d965655353a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562917} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c7e2a8e-c431-5d07-a1c8-050d821fbc8f" :answer-field/key "The product $RP$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562891} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ef90c50-c0ed-5d96-9665-4922437d58f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562859} {:answer/id #uuid "bd996ffd-f797-5509-9bbe-b47b6aeefa46" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562901}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2ef90c50-c0ed-5d96-9665-4922437d58f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562859} :answer-field/id #uuid "a3c54a46-9187-506d-a306-7298aa00b5a1" :answer-field/key "The product $PR$ is well defined." :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186562895}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "93240880-0a92-5ff3-9e93-67e683dcedec" :question/problem "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -5 & -8 & -8 \\\\ -5 & -2 & 8 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $O$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix, $P$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $R$ is a $3\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $R$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $R$ and $P$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{✓}{P}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $3$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $P$ and $R$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{R}_{3\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $4$ columns in $O$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $O$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{2\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nThe product $RP$ is well defined. The products $PR$ and $OP$ are undefined."}]
